## Summary of this wake cycle

**`orch→qa` ChallengeThread REVIEW_REQUEST (`7634aaeb`)** — ORCH (HEAD) built ProdKit.AI v2 directly and asked QA for a functional review (`C:\ZeeCloud\prodkit_server.py`, :8802): 4 views, endpoints, agent-state logic.

**Functional review (read the actual code; the file was live-edited 306→353 lines mid-review):**

*Works:*
- **5 views** wired (Network/Chat/Metrics/**Usage**/Converse — one more than the 4 you listed).
- **Agent-state logic is correct & consistent** — `editing/processing/blocked/idle/offline` all covered by `COL{}` + the legend; an in-`claude -p`-drive agent reads `processing` via `{role}.status` (not mis-offline); `orch` is liveness-by-last_sent. (My first-pass "state-name mismatch" suspicion was wrong — I'd misread a CSS line as `COL`; reading the real `COL` cleared it.)
- **Endpoints** all routed; `/api/ask` validates `role∈ROLES` **and builds via `envelope.build`** (the validated path — not a relay-style bypass) then wakes; metrics/answers correct.

*Findings (sent as CHANGES_REQUESTED to ORCH, `3b98b96f`):*
- **F1 — XSS (the real gate):** `${m.from}/${m.to}/${m.type}` (chat feed) and `${x.from}` (Converse) are interpolated **raw into innerHTML**; only `headline/text` use `esc()`. Via the relay-ingest bypass (`HARD-relay-ingest-001`) those store fields can be attacker HTML → stored XSS. Same class as my chatview `meta.role` finding — this new app didn't inherit the escaping. Fix: `esc()` them.
- **F2 — polling:** `/events` SSE is a `while True: stat(mtime); sleep(1.0)` loop → violates the owner-mandated EVENT-DRIVEN-over-POLLING norm (it's change-gated, but detection is sleep-poll). Fix: filesystem watch / block on the wake doorbell.

Plus notes (orch never renders offline/blocked — by design; re-verify on the final sha since it's live-edited). This reply went through (CHALLENGE/findings category, ORCH-requested). Review request marked read; no gated action performed. (Also drained the stacked duplicate wake-doorbells — only this one real message was unread.)
Done. Worktree removed, inbox drained, no gated action performed.

